    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 62,
        "text": "Hi, Lisa. You look busy. What's that big plan on your desk?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "108696bfc79436f8805a501a82260a2dec125130f79605fe6485bed8e016d0d4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 66,
        "sourceEnd": 236,
        "text": "It's for the library garden project. We're turning the empty yard behind the library into a reading garden. The idea is that people can sit outside and read among plants.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "8be0d529246775cedbf0331455390b15f3ced9cbb355be0d12c2ef633122149b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 240,
        "sourceEnd": 276,
        "text": "That sounds lovely. Who's in charge?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "4f0d4acd9ed205121d15a1f55c4c2f67c7ec070d61f3679326a141e91ab8585d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 280,
        "sourceEnd": 395,
        "text": "Well, I thought I was, but actually the head librarian, Mrs. Chen, is leading it. I'm just helping with the design.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "3c1573c77cadbed20930c87f9ac42ca5dd3c585dbd550966d3700c0881ffaae1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 399,
        "sourceEnd": 440,
        "text": "I see. So what's the plan for the garden?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "ba42046c73cce7f9952441b2c0784fceaa8203f3ef056348e410ccc0bfd05971",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 444,
        "sourceEnd": 642,
        "text": "We want to create different areas. There will be a quiet corner with benches under a big tree, a small vegetable patch that children can help with, and a reading circle where we can hold story time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e3899edbbecd6f4f2250c68c3ba23619d03a38d23da2acd0b4dc21a2db9b7933",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 646,
        "sourceEnd": 685,
        "text": "A vegetable patch? In a library garden?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "86c333b3ab5d2f6b42bcb1c327f40ed130053a619a38e2dde19179b5e81b9f1a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 689,
        "sourceEnd": 821,
        "text": "Yes, it's for the children's gardening club. They'll grow tomatoes and beans. It's meant to teach them about nature while they read.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "27aa6cc13d412d7e037ba891d6f17f85e55652b18e95773414bcb2ebec9ea5d3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 825,
        "sourceEnd": 875,
        "text": "That's a nice idea. But isn't the yard very shady?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "3d89723ec73add3c628f380f9905c9801e5bc94524405a2662e15215af50d29f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 879,
        "sourceEnd": 1014,
        "text": "It is, but we've chosen plants that grow well in shade, like ferns and hostas. We might also add some colourful pots to brighten it up.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "d3c934f2e62431701c7e22d5a7bab42d0485e77ac8ea11e7bc606c3d9c5bc835",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1018,
        "sourceEnd": 1053,
        "text": "And who will look after the garden?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "4db31e4c058b19fe93741e60f1c095a364fb5b826f745b25d324ad3b2674979f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1057,
        "sourceEnd": 1218,
        "text": "A group of volunteers, mostly parents and older students. They'll take turns watering and weeding. We're also hoping to get some help from a local garden centre.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c1fe112648c71774f4c9e74f118e9e4eefaaea5ce6b40547222c5a4738e05090",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1222,
        "sourceEnd": 1247,
        "text": "When will it be finished?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "ab494295fd24cabde877264e649c064c59491ebf9c04d760669aa8b4854bba40",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1251,
        "sourceEnd": 1358,
        "text": "If everything goes to plan, by the end of June. But it could take longer if we don't get enough volunteers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "63257426cb80331b4658378f3c995e66eb2fe6dd80901a71c2a963ad03eeb661",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1362,
        "sourceEnd": 1428,
        "text": "I could help. I'm not great at gardening, but I can paint benches.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "37835a0b965420a1eac03cfaf41be86119564d66ba100d92edcbd5d9f11c31a2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1432,
        "sourceEnd": 1516,
        "text": "That would be great! We need someone to paint the benches and the sign. Thanks, Tom.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "afa03095eae80d71c923541c1b54116542d8753ac3d8eaa6a143a3a2766541b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1520,
        "sourceEnd": 1587,
        "text": "No problem. Oh, one more thing—will the garden be open to everyone?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "7050ce3dc81c8bf8df5af221f5590cd752ad4ffe0a7e2ba38190a29e98174cd6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1591,
        "sourceEnd": 1678,
        "text": "Yes, during library hours. But we might need to limit numbers at busy times. We'll see.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e3568870f5971e73a2efaa4ded364bb98b360bf8a852be9f8270e49f8070d267",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1682,
        "sourceEnd": 1717,
        "text": "Sounds sensible. Good luck with it!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "d9c6ca60fc013bd36a422671b7617aa75ffaf090fac28f3fba4435ba95f08588",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1721,
        "sourceEnd": 1728,
        "text": "Thanks!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "1aa7b1c1d5fb1fd6d299eae251a665c7898baeb43d48fb6b8a5b76da6c6ef739",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
